    "body": "See https://github.com/matomo-org/matomo/blob/3.5.0-rc1/core/Tracker/Request.php#L830-L832\r\n\r\nIf the privacy feature introduced in Matomo 3.5.0 is enabled and the userId is hashed with a salt, then the visitorId would still kind of leak the userId. Ideally, when the userId is set and the feature is enabled, then the userId should be salted there as well.",
